OpenACAI Endnight Loader
Copyright (C) 2026 Alex Cooper

OpenACAI Endnight Loader contains original compatibility glue code by Alex Cooper.
It is intentionally built on top of BepInEx's Unity IL2CPP loader work and
RedLoader/SonsSdk's Sons Of The Forest modding work. OpenACAI preserves and
credits both upstream projects:

- BepInEx, by the BepInEx team: https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
- Dobby, BepInEx fork based on jmpews/Dobby: https://github.com/BepInEx/Dobby
- RedLoader/SonsSdk, by Toni Macaroni: https://github.com/ToniMacaroni/RedLoader
- Tomlet and SemanticVersioning, used as small managed compatibility and SDK
  support dependencies while OpenACAI absorbs RedLoader/SonsSdk behavior.

Those upstream components remain under their own licenses and copyright notices.

The private OpenACAI companion/admin mod is not part of this public repository.
